readmeText = "README
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v0.1.13 - Custom Window Update (20/07/2026)
- Fixed texture bu for Luna and Olive Scroll Bars
- Fixed Control Anchors for Apps
- Fixed Theme biug for custom window apps

v0.1.13 - Custom Window Update (20/07/2026)
- Added Small Icons Setting for the Desktop
- Fixed a bug where Secret 3 Flags would reset if music player was closed early
- Added Custom Window Implementation with Custom Program Icons, Tile bar Buttons (Min, Max, Restore, Close), and Custom Resizing Handles
- Implemented Custom Window for the following programs:
	- Media Player
	- Music Player
	- Memes Folder
	- Notepad
	- Pictures
- Updated Themes for use with Custom Window
- Fixed Texture Bug with Certain Themes
- Updated Browser(Globe Trotter) Icon with NEW Classic and Modern Sprite
- Removed extraneous video files for Browser GIF Placeholder
- Updated Configs

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v0.1.12.1 - Media Player Update 2 (03/06/2026)
- Added NEW Radial Visualizer
- Restructured Resource File Structure
- Implemented Secret 3 Triggers

HINT FOR SECRET 3: (Unlock 1 + 2 First)
2. LISTEN for the flap of Butterflies wings.
1. LOOK for the sun when it shines down on you.
3. When you dream, sit down and reflect.

v0.1.12 - Media Player Update 1 (26/05/2026)
- Implemented Secret 3 (NEW MEDIA PLAYER :D)
	- Added new media player for enhanced video playback
	- Comes with new cartoon (PLANETRONIKA by Rafael Andaya)
- Cleaned up Music Player UI
- Fixed minor Audio Visualizer Visual Bug where spectrum was not centered properly
- Added Display Panel UI theme
- Added alternative button themes
- Updated export presets
- Updated git workflow
- Updated .gitignore

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v0.1.11-1 - Massive QoL Update (19/05/2026)
- Remade Album System:
	- Albums are now imported directly from resources at runtime (musicFiles.gd)
	- Removed premade Tracks and Albums Resources
	- Tracks and Albums are created at runtime, with info derived from metadata
	- Album Art is now updated per track from metadata via 'metadata_block_picture' and coverArt property
- Memes are now returned using a shuffle bag algorithm
- Recompressed existing videos for smaller file size
- Compressed User Icons and backgrounds (lossless to lossy)
- Fixed Bug where settings and volume control theme did not update correctly

v0.1.11 - Featureless QoL Update (11/05/2026)
- Window order can now be changed by Taskbar buttons and Icons
- Updated Window Tile for Luna theme
- Added Custom Desktop Icon
- Updated Export Preset with Game Description
- Taskbar icons now update with icon style

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.10-1 - Volume Control Window (10/03/2026)
- Enabled volume sliders for Music and SFX in Options Menu
- Added \"Audio Settings\" Button  to Settings App
- Enabled Full Volume Control Window
- Added \"Ding\" SFX
- Volume Popup now plays \"Ding\" sound when changed
- Muting now disables associated Slider(s)

v0.1.10 - Audio Controls (09/03/2026)
- Added Volume Settings to Options Menu
- Added Volume Icon to System Tray Panel + Popup
- Added Panner (effect) to audio buses to adjust audio balance
- Added Volume Control Menu (not yet enabled)
- Updated Texture filtering to Nearest on several Windows
- Updated Slider Themes

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.9-3 - Hotfix #1 (04/03/2026)
- Fixed bug where PC App did not update theme with rest of system
- Clock Timer is no longer affected by time scale
- Fixed bug where Secret 2 played \"Error\" sound instead of \"Alert\" sound

v0.1.9-2 - Theme Update (03/03/2026)
- Split Zune and Royale Dark Themes (eXP-Themes)
- Added Zune and Royale Dark Start Button, Taskbar, and Taskbuttons

v0.1.9-1 - Notepad Bug Fixes + Shader Adjustment (02/03/2026)
- Fixed bug where overwriting active file would break previously saved files
- Fixed bug where Meme Folder and Player would not close power options/shutdown
- Meme player now closes if meme folder is closed
- Reduced Gaussian Blur filter blur radius from 8 to 4 to improve performance
- Added Taskbar Panel with Realtime clock :D

v0.1.9 - Notepad Extensions + Bug Fixes (01/03/2026)
- Fixed bug where secrets would disappear when logging off
- Added My PC App
- Implemented Notepad File Menu:
	- New text files can be created
	- New files can be saved
	- Existing Files can be overwritten
	- Saved Files can be Opened from Submenu
	- On exit, user will prompted to save
- Enforced minimum size for taskbar buttons
- Added Fullscreen Toggle to settings (How TH did I not do this sooner!?)
- Updated Themes to use Black Line Caret and darker placeholder text

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.8-3 - Memes Tasks + Flow containers (25/02/2026)
- Replaced desktop icon container with VFlowContainers
- Meme Folder Subwindow now has taskbutton

v0.1.8-2 - Window Limits + Flow Containers (24/02/2026)
- Replaced folder rows wit HFlowContainers
- Added size limits and resize flags for various windows to avoid clipping

v0.1.8-1 - Notepad Status (23/02/2026)
- Added Status Bar to Notepad
- Made README File Editable

v0.1.8 - Notepad Update (22/02/2026)
- Added README File :D
- Added TextFile/Notepad Instance
- Added Text File Icons
- Added Notepad Button Overrides
- Updated Window Titles

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.7-1 - Hotfix (21/02/2026)
- Fixed bug where video player keeps playing when opening image
- Made media window open in front of other window when selecting new media
- Fixed Bug where desktop wallpaper resets to bliss after logging off and on
- Ensured Randomness does not repeat previous video

v0.1.7 - Themes + Music Player UI (20/02/2026)
- Remade Error Dialog System + SAIKNEKY Album
- Added Persistence between main and settings menu.
- Fixed Bug where troll would not close during power options.
- Dialog windows now close with everything else during power options.
- Fixed bug where troll would duplicate taskbar button
- Implemented Taskbar Panel, currently hidden.
- Implemented Second Secret
  - Added More memes
  - Added secret folder for memes

HINT FOR SECRET 2: Find the memes

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.6 - Themes + Music Player UI (11/02/2026)
- Added the eXP-Themes
- Added Theme Overrides for Music Player with Classic style buttons
- Migrated classic style overrides to eXP theme folder.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.5-2 - Hotfix #2 (08/02/2026)
- Fixed Name Persistence
- Re-added Fullscreen
- Upgrade actions/checkout to v4 and enable Git LFS
- Normalized .jpg extensions and removed faulty astronaut .jpg

v0.1.5-1 - Hotfix #1 (20/01/2026)
- Fixed Taskbar appearing in front  of gray screen during power opt. animation
- Fixed Error Window not closing during power off animation
- Fixed Power Options not opening due to lack of error instance.


v0.1.5 - Taskbar Update (19/01/2026)
- Cleaned up UI Elements
- Added Taskbar Buttons to minimize windows
- Added True Multitasking
- Multiple Apps can now be opened at a time

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.4 - Audio Update - Part 2 (15/01/2026)
- Created SFX and AudioLibrary class
- Created XP AudioLibrary for common SFX Reference
- Implemented TRUE Polyphony for ALL SFX (SFX no longer interrupts each other)
- Added Non-poly method
- Fixed \"notify\" tag in SFX
- Re-enabled Options Screen
- Added Filter Settings
- Adjusted UI Containers
- Fixed Main Scene Bug
- Added Preview button for viewing filters
- Fixed Music Restarting when returning to main menu

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.3 - Audio Update - Part 1 (13/01/2026)
- Added Togglable Panel Display
  - Panel Display now functions as a button which toggles visualizers.
- Added Dedicated SFX Player
- Updated SFX Player References
- Enabled Tactile Button Sounds for Music Player
- Globalized playSFX Function
  - playSFX() is now a global function with one simple implementation.
  - Also added GlassTap Sound for panel button.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.2 - File Conversions (12/01/2026)
- Converted all audio files to ogg
- Increased PNG compression

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.1 - Bugfix + Export Update (12/01/2026)
- Minor Audio and Filter Fix
- Separated Music and SFX into different audio buses
- Added polyphony up to 8 on SFX Bus
- Added Canvas Layer to enforce consistency of Soft Filter
- Added Soft Filter carry over to Log Screen
- Update export_presets.cfg
- Added Auto Itch Deployment
- Updated Exports for Mac Deployment

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

v0.1.0 - Initial Release (11/01/2026)

HINT FOR SECRET 1: 10 Red Errors

- Player Name and PFP Customization
- Web Browser App (W.I.P)
- Music Player
- Photos (Wallpaper) App
- Taskbar Themes
- Screen Filters:
	- Gaussian Blur Filter
	- CRT Filter
- Error Dialogs + Troll Easter Egg ;)
- Start Menu (W.I.P)
- Power Options
